# The Kind Cardian (jeuno 8): GM-set states no play reaches, where the Lua's checks still decide (each a step a GM can
# take). Teigero-Bangero: The Wonder Magic Set, Cook's Pride and The Lost Cardian completed, this quest available: no
# arm in his script (66 wants it accepted, 67 completed). Naruru: this quest accepted while The Wonder Magic Set is
# available and Cook's Pride available: no arm (71 wants Cook's Pride completed, 72 this quest completed): her 98.
# Panta-Putta: this quest completed with theKindCardianVar 2: 76, not 35.
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-56.0,0.1,-139.5 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.TheWonderMagicSet completed
quest Jeuno.CooksPride completed
quest Jeuno.TheLostCardian completed
login
trigger Teigero-Bangero                 # the turn: 34
finish
trigger Teigero-Bangero                 # this quest available: no arm: his script plays nothing; the lookup's 34
finish-if-event
quest Jeuno.TheWonderMagicSet available
quest Jeuno.CooksPride available
quest Jeuno.TheKindCardian accepted
trigger Naruru                          # Cook's Pride not completed, this quest accepted: no arm: 98
finish
quest Jeuno.TheKindCardian completed
charvar theKindCardianVar 2
trigger Panta-Putta                     # completed with the var 2: 76 (not 35: it wants this quest accepted)
finish
